title: "The Customer Is the Builder: How AI Coding Agents Are Rewriting the Economics of Software"
type: software
url: "https://github.com/riponcm/The-Customer-Is-the-Builder"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23524847"
repository-code: "https://github.com/riponcm/The-Customer-Is-the-Builder"
abstract: >-
  Research code, datasets, and notebooks for a study of how AI coding agents
  could change organizations' software build-versus-buy decisions. Public
  evidence connects agent capability, software creation, open-source
  alternatives, and purchasing indicators. Projections are conditional
  extrapolations, not forecasts of customer switching.
keywords:
  - AI coding agents
  - software economics
  - build versus buy
  - software substitution
  - open-source software
  - developer productivity
  - reproducible research
